      "id": 4350007,
      "name": "[Blueprint] Specialized Blade of the Other: Powerslash",
      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for this item. Purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\n\nItem Effect: When equipped, this item grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Powerful Slash Enhancement]\nEnhancement I: When Powerful Slash is used against an elite or boss enemy, it has a <color=#2BAD00>35%</color> chance to trigger Totalize even if you are not behind the target, dealing <color=#2BAD00>50%</color> additional DMG. \n\nEnhancement II: Perfect Block increases Daze buildup against normal/elite/boss enemies by <color=#2BAD00>100%/50%/25%</color>, respectively.\n\nAgainst enemies at <color=#CF4029>Lv. 60 or higher</color>, <color=#CF4029>Powerslash</color> deals <color=#CF4029>50%</color> less DMG.",
